Package: rustype
Version: 0.1.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: any
Maintainer: Nam Tran <support@namtr.dev>
Homepage: https://namtr.dev
Depends: libc6 (>= 2.34), ibus (>= 1.5.0), gnome-shell, python3 (>= 3.8), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Description: Lightweight Vietnamese input method for GNOME (IBus)
 Rustype is a modern, high-performance, and privacy-focused Vietnamese
 input method for GNOME. rustype-linux speaks the IBus protocol itself and
 replaces ibus-daemon for the GNOME session.
 .
 Key features:
  * Pure Rust engine with zero external C/GUI dependencies in core.
  * Extremely low resource footprint (~450 KB binary, ~2.5 MB RAM).
  * Full Telex and VNI support with modern and traditional orthography.
  * Intelligent application-specific behavior (terminal preedit, direct mode).
  * Native GTK4 Libadwaita settings app with automatic Dark/Light theme.
  * Built-in system diagnostic health check (rustype-linux --doctor).
  * 100% offline with zero network connectivity and zero keylogging.
